  message: "Preliminary analysis from last session sidecar (444 events): LLM selected 704 playbook injections total, 101 actually injected (14%), 603 skipped by dedup (86%). Top selected: smart-test-playbook (124x selected, only 10x injected), coverage-and-test-placement (90x/10x), structural-fix (81x/8x). The dedup mechanism is working well. Full read-then-injected cross-reference (requiring transcript analysis) deferred — the dedup rate alone shows the injection pipeline is not wasteful."  # 12f2
